<title>USA: Gadzooks Inc Q1 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Gadzooks Inc Q1 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, expect per share data)</p>
<p>						    First Quarter Ended</p>
<p>						  May 3,	    Apr 27,</p>
<p>						    1997		 1996</p>
<p> Net Sales			     $    34,070	$    23,486</p>
<p> Gross Profit				 10,127		6,947</p>
<p> Operating income			    1,893		  961</p>
<p> Net income				    1,324		  738</p>
<p> Net per share				  0.15		 0.08</p>
<p> Shares outstanding			  9,124		9,030</p>
<p>Note: The company said comparable-store sales were up 4.4 percent from a year ago. Operating income was 5.6 percent of sales in Q1 vs 4.1 percent a year ago due to a 140 basis point reduction in selling, general and administrative expenses.</p>
